---
title: "SmartBuild System Flowchart — Part 1: Access, Authentication and Home"
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "layout": "elk", "flowchart": {"curve": "linear", "nodeSpacing": 40, "rankSpacing": 45}, "themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "fontSize": "14px", "primaryColor": "#E8F6FC", "primaryBorderColor": "#17A6DF", "primaryTextColor": "#011723", "lineColor": "#4A5A66"}}}%%
flowchart TD
  Start([Start]) --> Open[/Open SmartBuild app/]
  Open --> Net{Internet<br/>connected?}
  Net -- No --> Lost[Show 'Connection lost'<br/>dialog and wait] --> Net
  Net -- Yes --> Sess{Already<br/>signed in?}

  Sess -- No --> Login[Log In screen]
  Login --> Act{Choose action}
  Act -- Log In --> Cred[/Enter email<br/>and password/] --> Valid{Valid and<br/>confirmed?}
  Valid -- No --> Err[Show error message] --> Login
  Act -- Register --> Reg[/Enter email and password<br/>at least 8 characters/] --> Conf[Confirm account<br/>through email link] --> Login
  Act -- Forgot Password --> FP[/Enter email/] --> RL[Open reset link and<br/>set new password] --> Login

  Valid -- Yes --> Home
  Sess -- Yes --> Home[Home screen<br/>load and sync progress<br/>show module cards]
  B(["B: back from Part 2"]) --> Home
  Home --> Choice{Select}
  Choice -- Module card --> A(["A: continue in Part 2"])
  Choice -- Component Search --> Srch[Search or browse parts<br/>view part details] --> Home
  Choice -- Profile --> Prof{Profile action}
  Prof -- Log out --> Login
  Prof -- Delete account --> Del[Confirm, then delete<br/>account and progress] --> Login
  Choice -- Close app --> Stop([End])

  classDef terminal fill:#011723,stroke:#011723,color:#FFFFFF
  classDef decision fill:#FFF6DD,stroke:#D9A300,color:#3A2C00
  classDef connector fill:#17A6DF,stroke:#0D6E96,color:#FFFFFF,font-weight:bold
  class Start,Stop terminal
  class Net,Sess,Act,Valid,Choice,Prof decision
  class A,B connector
